# Keep committed test fixtures even though they share generated-artifact
# extensions (*.qraw, *.net, *.cir, *.log). Anything under tests/fixtures/ is
# curated input, not a generated artifact.
!tests/fixtures/**

# Keep the curated QSpice log-classification corpus (real + synthetic) tracked
# even though *.log is otherwise ignored. These pin the adapter contract tests.
!tests/data/qspice_logs/**